title: Beau_Extreme
---
<<set_left CharacterManager Beau>>
<<wait .15>>
<<set_right CharacterManager Francine>>
<<wait .15>>
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Beau: Man, this is great, Francine. I feel like we haven’t talked in forever.
-> Really? I thought we talked recently.
-> Yeah, it’s been a while!
Beau: Eeeeverything feels like it was forever ago. I’m beat, dude.
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: Are you okay?
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Beau: Yeah, I just joined extreme curling, so it’s been a real whirlwind. MUCH different than casual curling. I feel like I got hit by a stone.
<<right CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Francine: …why are you doing it then?
<<left CharacterManager>>
<<wait .15>>
Beau: Oh, it’s great training for casual curling! I’ve been trying to improve my sweeping technique lately. The terror really adds to it.
<<ending CharacterManager>>
===
